                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0edfd2bf-a67a-3953-9107-a01e3940c293",
                        "entry_id": "53e87c1a-532a-314b-908b-47f3881c6886",
                        "glosses": [
                            "женск. к аристократ"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c7d8bb28-f037-49e6-9ad6-d2cd9c2ecd4e",
                                "sense_id": "0edfd2bf-a67a-3953-9107-a01e3940c293",
                                "text": "Он аристократ; а ты именем, воспитанием разве не аристократка?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2e5122dd-99ae-410c-967f-39d204537c02",
                                "sense_id": "0edfd2bf-a67a-3953-9107-a01e3940c293",
                                "text": "Maman моя, урождённая Войдзицкая, вела жизнь самую приятную; имела прекрасную квартиру, великолепный экипаж и одевалась с такою роскошью, что самые гордые петербургские аристократки завидовали ей."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fbee0fa4-ac1e-42f6-b283-4254afed6f3d",
                                "sense_id": "0edfd2bf-a67a-3953-9107-a01e3940c293",
                                "text": "[Софья Александровна, 20, дочь Александра Владимировича от первого брака] Я институтка, Елена Андреевна аристократка, одеваемся мы по моде, а вы демократ…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a46d9e00-755a-4356-bef1-665d47252439",
                        "source_entry_id": "53e87c1a-532a-314b-908b-47f3881c6886",
                        "source_sense_id": "0edfd2bf-a67a-3953-9107-a01e3940c293",
                        "target_lang_word": "aristocrat",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "aristocrat",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0c8ada88-a7c3-3408-9319-93348d2bdf4d",
                                        "entry_id": "075fb10f-d26f-3ba5-b537-819582c14ab3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One of the aristocracy, nobility, or people of rank in a community; one of a ruling class; a noble (originally in Revolutionary France)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4109b37b-a04c-4505-aec5-df4914838cb1",
                                                "sense_id": "0c8ada88-a7c3-3408-9319-93348d2bdf4d",
                                                "text": "The remains of a Roman aristocrat have been unearthed by archaeologists in northern England."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "894bb6e5-4bd0-4696-84ee-cda2a21b3ed4",
                                                "sense_id": "0c8ada88-a7c3-3408-9319-93348d2bdf4d",
                                                "text": "Magazines kept aristocrats on the payroll to facilitate access to jet-set playgrounds like Corfu and Mustique."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a5239e8e-d0af-3726-a695-5fbad73438db",
                                        "entry_id": "075fb10f-d26f-3ba5-b537-819582c14ab3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A proponent of aristocracy; an advocate of aristocratic government."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3985762-bbf2-4242-809b-0c73ef7dc074",
                                                "sense_id": "a5239e8e-d0af-3726-a695-5fbad73438db",
                                                "text": "Professor Fite, in The Platonic Legend, deprecates earlier idealization, and finds Plato to be an aristocrat, something of a snob, and the advocate of a restrictively organized society.\n[…]\nPlato was, as has so often been observed, temperamentally an aristocrat. And he believed that the qualities needed in his rulers were, in general, hereditary, and that given knowledge and opportunity you could deliberately breed for them."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "163a95cc-a7a5-3d1a-9c49-1c8526c40ff4",
                                        "entry_id": "075fb10f-d26f-3ba5-b537-819582c14ab3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cipher in which the original punctuation and spacing are retained."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "43f1a824-5bdf-432b-a70d-819f8a3e05c1",
                        "source_entry_id": "53e87c1a-532a-314b-908b-47f3881c6886",
                        "source_sense_id": "0edfd2bf-a67a-3953-9107-a01e3940c293",
